                                            {
                                                "example_id": "575e2662-bad7-442b-99d2-8f89f8f97198",
                                                "sense_id": "9d477f7f-ec81-35d3-9902-20a498491b1f",
                                                "text": "So that over and above the public components – holidays, tourist attractions – there are private meanderings, linked to the climate as if this spell were a stretto passage in the year’s fugue: haphazard weather, aimless loves, unpredicted commitments…"
